docker/patches/mooncake-rdma-polling-only.patch modifies Mooncake
(https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake, Apache License 2.0), which the runtime
image downloads and builds; no Mooncake source is included.

The router (evolving_infra/router/core/) links the dynamo-tokenizers crate (lib/tokenizers) of
NVIDIA Dynamo (https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo, commit 1efdd4dcb901), Copyright 2025-2026
NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Cargo fetches
it at build time (Cargo.toml pins the commit); no Dynamo source is included in this repository,
and router binaries contain it.

The KV indexer integration (evolving_infra/router/indexer/) runs NVIDIA Dynamo's indexer
from the ai-dynamo Python package (Apache License 2.0) as an external, pinned dependency;
no Dynamo source is included.

